# 7pair-3axs.tws (from 7pair-3ax.tws): stage 3ax generation in the reduced move set F R B L 2U 3U 2D 3D.
# Those moves never move a U or D centre piece, so every set keeps only its 16 side pieces
# (L F R B, in that order).  Solved: PAIRA, PAIRB two colours (F/B 1, L/R 2: the 3ax goal);
# MID2, MID3 four colours (L 1, F 2, R 3, B 4), so every identity solve keeps the other oblique
# orbits.  Rotations y, z as in 7pair-4op.tws.  Uniquify with 7pair-3axs-uniq.tws.
Name PuzzleGeometryPuzzle

Set MID2 16 1
Set PAIRA 16 1
Set MID3 16 1
Set PAIRB 16 1

